    "regime_notes": "Daily IC was positive in the full sample; 2020-2022 was positive, 2023-2026 and 2031-2034 were near zero, and 2027-2030 was negative. The one-day admission passes the benchmark gates, but longer-horizon decay is poor and the small cross-section warrants conservative use.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20350108_volume_confirmed_reversal5_signal.csv",
